    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "The Palladio json files, when loaded into the Palladio application or Palladio Bricks (embedded Palladio visualizations) produce an interlinked set of map, facet filter, timeline and tabular or gallery views of the data. These visualizations are interactive. The set of parameters in the two Palladio save files included here were specified by the author and correspond to related articles published within the Mapping the Republic of Letters project at Stanford University.",
